From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:03:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): show checked floor for machine-default holders

Read the stored default profile and apply the conservative parameter floor
when the editor still mirrors the landed body. Keep explicit and edited
draft envelopes unchanged. Pin the displayed bands and draft controls.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2009
